# validate-spec-test-paths baseline — Research Lab
#
# `tests/*.mjs` paths named by a committed spec artifact that do NOT exist on
# disk. Frozen so the guard can fail on NEW stale references while this
# pre-existing set is triaged.
#
# Keyed on the missing PATH, not on the referencing site. A new reference to a
# path already listed here passes; a reference to a path NOT listed here FAILS.
# That is the regression this guard exists to stop.
#
# THIS LIST MUST SHRINK, NEVER GROW. Every entry is one of:
#   - planned but never written   -> write the test, or drop the plan row
#   - renamed or moved            -> repoint the reference
#   - naming-convention drift     -> reconcile the plan against disk
#   - captured terminal evidence of a since-deleted scratch file -> a
#     transcript, not a coverage claim; historical and grandfathered
#
# A baseline entry that is no longer missing is reported as STALE and the run
# still exits 0. Remove it. Do NOT regenerate the baseline to silence a
# genuine new finding.
#
# Regenerate ONLY when deliberately accepting the current set:
#   node scripts/validate-spec-test-paths.mjs --update-baseline
#
# There is no --skip / --force / --ignore / --bypass flag and there never will
# be. A bypass-shaped flag exits non-zero.
#
# FROZEN: 86 missing path(s) across 1775 reference site(s), on 2026-07-30.
#
# ---- debt attribution ------------------------------------------------------
#   paths | sites | spec | status
#      31 |   102 | specs/002-distributed-tool-briefs-and-history | status=done  <-- see NOTE
#      20 |   128 | specs/012-market-action-center-and-guided-tools | status=blocked
#      10 |   427 | specs/008-portfolio-survival-and-brief-lab | status=not_started
#       8 |   287 | specs/014-shared-cycle-and-seasonality-exchange | status=not_started
#       8 |   377 | specs/015-recommendation-outcome-ledger-and-track-record | status=blocked
#       6 |    81 | specs/001-causal-rotation-intelligence | status=not_started
#       3 |   120 | specs/013-market-regime-stack-and-strategy-playbook | status=in_progress
#       1 |   253 | specs/016-auction-gamma-playbook | status=not_started
#
# ---- NOTE: a status=done spec is carrying frozen debt -----------------------
#
# A not_started spec whose Test Plan names an unwritten test is expected debt.
# A status=done spec is a materially different class and is called out here so
# it stays visible to whoever pays this down rather than lost in the list.
#
#   specs/002-distributed-tool-briefs-and-history — status=done
#     31 distinct missing path(s) across 102 reference site(s)
#         98 site(s) in plan context — a forward-looking coverage claim
#          4 site(s) in report.md — an EVIDENCE context, not a plan context
#
# `report.md` is captured-transcript and gap-declaration space. A stale path
# there may be a verbatim terminal capture of a scratch file that has since
# been deleted, or the report explicitly documenting that a planned path does
# NOT exist. Read the site before treating it as a false coverage claim; the
# remedy is usually owned by the planning artifact, not by the report.
#
# ---- frozen paths (LC_ALL=C sorted) -----------------------------------------

